# Vercel upload exclusions — the CLI uploads everything not listed here, and
# the deploy was rejected with "File size limit exceeded (100 MB)" because a
# 242 MB packages.rar plus local Android/Gradle outputs were being sent.
node_modules
.git
*.rar
*.apk
*.aab
*.jks
.opencode
.kiro
.vscode
release
**/android/app/build
**/android/.gradle
**/android/build
**/dist
*.log
# Never upload secrets: the CLI does not apply .gitignore for env files.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
